00:37:13.130 --> 00:37:15.499 line:0%
BECAUSE ONCE WE GET THEM
CREATIVE IN WAYS TO MAKE

00:37:15.599 --> 00:37:17.434 line:0%
MONEY, I THINK IT'S
GOING TO BE UH, SOME,

00:37:17.534 --> 00:37:18.902 line:0%
SOME GREAT ACCOMPLISHMENTS.

00:37:19.003 --> 00:37:20.137 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON:
THE SKY IS THE LIMIT.

00:37:20.237 --> 00:37:21.472 line:0%
MIKE MASSIMINO: THE SKY IS
THE LIMIT ONCE THAT HAPPENS.

00:37:21.572 --> 00:37:22.807 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON:
YOU GOT IT, ALRIGHT,

00:37:22.907 --> 00:37:24.541 line:0%
WHEN STARTALK CONTINUES.

