<i> [AUDIENCE APPLAUSE].</i>

00:37:46.463 --> 00:37:47.998 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON:
WE'RE BACK ON STARTALK.

00:37:48.098 --> 00:37:50.134 line:0%
FEATURING MY INTERVIEW
