I HAD TO TALK TO THE NEW,

00:38:14.125 --> 00:38:15.325 line:0%
NEW HEAD OF THAT.

00:38:15.425 --> 00:38:17.395 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON: WHICH
