00:38:18.996 --> 00:38:20.631 line:0%
FIGURE OUT HOW TO LIVE
WHEN YOU GET THERE.

00:38:20.731 --> 00:38:22.266 line:0%
EXTRACT WATER FROM THE SOIL.

00:38:22.366 --> 00:38:24.368 line:0%
BUZZ ALDRIN: YEAH,
NOW, IF I WENT TO SAY,

00:38:24.468 --> 00:38:26.803 line:0%
"WHAT IS THE BEST, WHAT
IS THE MOST IMPORTANT THING

00:38:26.903 --> 00:38:32.610 line:0%
THAT WE NEED FOR THE FUTURE?"

00:38:34.812 --> 00:38:37.280 line:0%
ROCKET FUEL.

00:38:37.380 --> 00:38:41.351 line:0%
TO REFUEL ROCKETS
HEADING FOR MARS.

00:38:41.651 --> 00:38:46.623 line:0%
IF YOU CAN'T DO THAT, ALL
OF THAT HAS TO BE LIFTED UP.

00:38:46.724 --> 00:38:51.461 line:0%
OH, IS IT SO MUCH MORE
EXPENSIVE IN TIME AND

00:38:51.561 --> 00:38:52.796 line:0%
EVERYTHING ELSE.

00:38:52.896 --> 00:38:54.098 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON:
YOU WANT FILLING STATIONS

00:38:54.198 --> 00:38:55.365 line:0%
THROUGHOUT THE SOLAR SYSTEM?

00:38:55.465 --> 00:38:59.169 line:0%
BUZZ ALDRIN: WELL, WE
WANT ONE CERTAINLY WHERE A

00:38:59.269 --> 00:39:01.037 line:0%
FAIR AMOUNT
OF FUEL WE CAN KEEP.

00:39:01.137 --> 00:39:02.806 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON: I
LOVE IT BECAUSE YOU'VE BEEN

00:39:02.906 --> 00:39:04.208 line:0%
TRY, TYING TO LEAD THE CHARGE.

00:39:04.308 --> 00:39:06.009 line:0%
EVEN THE SHIRT YOUR WEARING.

00:39:06.110 --> 00:39:08.645 line:0%
OKAY, "GET
YOUR ASS TO MARS."

00:39:08.745 --> 00:39:11.181 line:0%
THAT IS A
BRILLIANT SHIRT, BRILLIANT.

00:39:11.281 --> 00:39:13.818 line:0%
I WANT TO BRING THE REST OF
MY BODY AS WELL AS MY ASS.

00:39:13.918 --> 00:39:16.253 line:0%
HE, HE WANTS TO GO
TO MARS SO BADLY,

00:39:16.353 --> 00:39:19.924 line:0%
THAT ANY TIME NASA TALKS ABOUT
GOING TO THE MOON, HE, HE,

00:39:20.024 --> 00:39:22.026 line:0%
HE FIGHTS AGAINST IT.

00:39:22.126 --> 00:39:23.493 line:0%
MIKE MASSIMINO: YEAH.

00:39:23.593 --> 00:39:25.162 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON: EVEN
IF THAT'S LIKE THE NEXT THING

00:39:25.262 --> 00:39:26.363 line:0%
NASA WANTS TO DO,
HE DOESN'T CARE.

00:39:26.463 --> 00:39:27.798 line:0%
HE WANTS TO GO TO MARS.

00:39:27.898 --> 00:39:31.001 line:0%
ALRIGHT, WELL BEFORE WE CLOSE
OUT THIS SHOW, AS ALWAYS WE,

00:39:31.101 --> 00:39:32.536 line:0%
I GOT TO CATCH
UP WITH MY BUDDY,

00:39:32.636 --> 00:39:34.238 line:0%
BILL NYE THE SCIENCE GUY.

00:39:34.338 --> 00:39:37.774 line:0%
AND I'M TOLD HE GAVE HIS
THOUGHTS ON THE APOLLO PROGRAM

00:39:37.874 --> 00:39:40.478 line:0%
WHILE AT THE UN.

00:39:41.812 --> 00:39:42.947 line:0%
AND I SAID WHAT?

00:39:43.047 --> 00:39:44.781 line:0%
WHAT, I HAVEN'T SEEN IT, I
HAVEN'T SEEN IT, I JUST HEARD,

00:39:44.881 --> 00:39:46.750 line:0%
THIS IS A DISPATCH,
NYE TIMES IN THE CITY.

00:39:46.850 --> 00:39:48.519 line:0%
FROM THE UN.

00:39:48.619 --> 00:39:50.855 line:0%
I GOTTA CHECK IT
OUT, LET'S SEE.

00:39:56.627 --> 00:40:00.931 line:0%
<i> [AUDIENCE APPLAUSE]</i>

00:40:02.266 --> 00:40:04.368 line:0%
BILL NYE:
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.

00:40:04.468 --> 00:40:08.072 line:0%
IN 1967, AS THE RACE
TO THE MOON WAS REALLY

00:40:08.172 --> 00:40:09.773 line:0%
PICKING UP SPEED,

00:40:09.873 --> 00:40:12.843 line:0%
COUNTRIES FROM ALL OVER
THE WORLD CAME TOGETHER AND

00:40:12.943 --> 00:40:15.646 line:0%
SIGNED THE OUTER SPACE TREATY.

00:40:15.746 --> 00:40:20.284 line:0%
IN IT, HUMANS FROM ALL OVER
THE WORLD AGREED THAT NO

00:40:20.384 --> 00:40:24.788 line:0%
COUNTRY, NO ONE, COULD
LAY CLAIM TO A CELESTIAL BODY

00:40:24.888 --> 00:40:26.423 line:0%
LIKE THE MOON.

00:40:26.523 --> 00:40:29.659 line:0%
AND, AND CLAIM IT FOR
HIS, HER, OR ITSELF.

00:40:29.759 --> 00:40:33.697 line:0%
FURTHERMORE...

00:40:33.797 --> 00:40:37.868 line:0%
THE TREATY HOLDS THAT NO ONE,
OR COUNTRY CAN INTERFERE WITH

00:40:37.968 --> 00:40:40.871 line:0%
ANY LIFE WE MIGHT
FIND OUT THERE.

00:40:40.971 --> 00:40:44.441 line:0%
THIS IS THE "PRIME DIRECTIVE."

00:40:44.641 --> 00:40:46.843 line:0%
I'M SURE YOU OR YOUR FRIENDS
ARE FAMILIAR WITH IT,

00:40:46.943 --> 00:40:48.278 line:0%
IT'S FROM STAR TREK.

00:40:48.378 --> 00:40:49.679 line:0%
CAN'T INTERFERE.

00:40:49.780 --> 00:40:51.782 line:0%
BRILLIANT.

00:40:51.882 --> 00:40:55.452 line:0%
NOW IT TURNS OUT THAT THE
PRIME DIRECTIVE IS EXTRACTED

00:40:55.552 --> 00:40:59.890 line:0%
ENTIRELY FROM THE CHARTER
OF THE UNITED NATIONS.

00:40:59.990 --> 00:41:04.294 line:0%
THEY BOTH SAY LET'S AGREE
TO PREVENT AGGRESSION.

00:41:04.394 --> 00:41:07.664 line:0%
EITHER MILITARY OR BIOLOGICAL.

00:41:07.764 --> 00:41:11.235 line:0%
BUT THE PRIME DIRECTIVE
IS THE SAME IDEA WRIT

00:41:11.335 --> 00:41:13.937 line:0%
ON A COSMIC SCALE.

00:41:14.037 --> 00:41:16.006 line:0%
BACK TO YOU, NEIL.

00:41:16.106 --> 00:41:20.911 line:0%
DR. NEIL DEGRASSE TYSON:
COOL, BILL NYE THE SCIENCE GUY.

00:41:21.011 --> 00:41:22.713 line:0%
HOW DID HE GET TO GIVE
A SPEECH AT THE UN?

00:41:22.813 --> 00:41:24.081 line:0%
HOW DID THAT, HOW DID HE?

